  "findings": [
    "Four Buffalo access maps restored with upper-launch and hand-carry limits; one Spring River downstream access-area map restored.",
    "Three Buffalo dotted overviews added. All mileage, guide durations, gauges and timing models remain unchanged.",
    "Tyler Bend, Buffalo Point and Dam 3 inventory pins are now honestly labeled approximate areas; no coordinate was moved.",
    "Bayou directions now show the agency slide-in-only restriction.",
    "Red Bluff remains held for a documented closure and flood damage; Slabtown remains held for conflicting agency status.",
    "Cold Springs–Dam 3 remains held: downstream public access does not validate passage through dam/hatchery structures. A 2025 third-party Cold Springs repair-closure report also needs primary reopening confirmation."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Local-only: no production change.",
    "No surveyed shoreline pin, vehicle access, carry geometry or navigability guarantee.",
    "Tyler Bend mileage-to-launch mismatch remains unresolved and trip-time estimates stay withheld.",
    "Baker–Tyler and Dam 3 source courses require correction before display."
